  "visualAssessment": {
    "currentNavigation": "The dark Research Intent label is now bright and distinguishable from the dark selected surface; its numbered marker is legible. The Project settings current-page label receives the same correction. Both themes and all three viewport sizes show the complete target label/marker/metadata with visible keyboard focus. Actual sample state confirms enabled controls rather than invoking a disabled-text exemption.",
